        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Betts, John Glenn\n- Roles: Ohio House of Representatives member, U.S. Senator, Marine Corps aviator, engineer, astronaut\n- Places: Ohio\n\nFacts:\n- In 1962, John Glenn became the first American to orbit the Earth and circled it three times.\n- John Glenn was born on July 18, 1921, and died on December 8, 2016.\n- John Glenn was a United States Marine Corps aviator, engineer, astronaut, and United States Senator from Ohio.\n- In 1980, Jim Betts ran against incumbent U.S. Senator John Glenn.\n- Jim Betts is a former member of the Ohio House of Representatives.",
